  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The additively manufactured Al0.2Co1.5CrFeNi1.5Ti0.3 alloy has a stable FCC matrix.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting alloy exhibits high strength and fatigue performance.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Localized laser remelting or targeted alloying can be used to enrich the alloy surface with Cr and Al.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The controlled comparison will expose treated and untreated specimens to an oxidizing atmosphere at 800–900 °C for 50–100 hours.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increasing surface Cr and Al will promote formation of a continuous, adherent mixed Cr-Al oxide scale.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction",
        "PMC10820071::web::014::3_4_oxidation_and_phase_transformations_"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The continuity and adherence of the surface oxide scale govern its ability to prevent oxygen ingress and degradation.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective scale on the enriched alloy will consist primarily of Cr2O3 and Al2O3.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A synergistic reaction between Cr and Al will produce a coherent protective scale.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A dense, continuous, adherent oxide scale suppresses inward oxygen diffusion and outward metal-cation transport.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppressing oxygen and metal-cation transport slows oxidation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-Al-rich protective scale will prevent scale spallation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Untreated specimens will form non-uniform oxides and may undergo spallation during thermal cycling, causing accelerated degradation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Surface-modified specimens will develop a more uniform oxide scale with smoother thickness and fewer defects than untreated specimens.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Surface-modified specimens will oxidize and degrade more slowly than the untreated as-built baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The surface modification and exposure will preserve the underlying FCC structure.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The surface-modified alloy will retain its mechanical performance after exposure.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Substantially different temperatures, exposure durations, or reducing gas compositions may activate degradation mechanisms outside the proposed oxidation-scale mechanism.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
